"Example. It must be rejected: a JSON file whose value is not an array holds one document, that value (SCH-018), which the schemas judge as they judge a YAML document. This value is a string and not a map, so it is not a template, an instance, a contract or a manifest, and it is rejected (SUB-005). A JSON file holds no comment, so this string says why it is here. The first build's log of increment 1 (docs/proposals/first-build/log-increment-1.md) added it."
